+<flag name="SpaceShower:QEDshowerByGamma" default="on">
+Allow a sea quark in a hadron beam to evolve backwards to a photon mother,
+using the photon PDF of that hadron. Requires QEDshowerByQ to be on.
+Flavours are restricted by nQuarkIn (at most five). Valence quarks do not
+convert. Charm and bottom conversions terminate at twice the squared shower
+mass; the emitted antiquark retains its shower mass.
+</flag>
+
+<parm name="SpaceShower:gammaToQuarkHeadroom" default="2." min="1.">
+Headroom on the sampled photon/quark PDF ratio for hadron conversions.
+The scale intervals and momentum-fraction grid are refreshed throughout
+the veto evolution. An observed overweight aborts rather than clipping the
+rate; increase this value and restart if that diagnostic is raised.
+</parm>
+
 <flag name="SpaceShower:QEDshowerByL" default="on"> 
 Allow leptons to radiate photons; on/off = true/false. 
 </flag> 
